      <chord name="D"/>To find <chord name="A/C#"/>a <chord name="Bm"/>friend <chord name="A"/>to <chord name="D"/>know <chord name="G/B"/>and <chord name="A"/>love;<br/>
      <chord name="D"/>Praise Him <chord name="C#dim"/>who <chord name="Bm"/>by <chord name="A"/>a <chord name="D/F#"/>simple <chord name="G"/>flower<br/>
